      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but it doesn't feel that way. it feels like the math just doesnt add up anymore. every month we fall further behind. if i wasn't here, she wouldn't have to worry about my medical bills or how i'm doing. she'd just have one less person to take care of. it almost seems like the most logical thing to do is just... stop making things harder for them.",
