    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's easy for you to say it's not a spreadsheet, but it is. it's real life. i've already started thinking about how much easier it would be if i just wasn't part of the equation anymore. it feels like the only way to actually be selfless. don't you think there's a point where giving up is actually a way of being kind?",
